    "text": "Tests that fail on a pull request they have nothing to do with, and pass on a rerun, cost a macOS job each time and teach people to rerun instead of read. Over 2026-11-16 to 2026-11-18 five such tests reddened pull requests or `main`. This spec fixes the four whose cause is shown, and lists the rest."
